 // [0] mode, [1] published, [2] clients opened, [3] StartIO, [4] StartIO refused, [5] frames passed to T970Audio, [6] write resyncs,
 // [7] frames dropped (ring full), [8] StopIO, [9] last volume step << 8 | mute, [10] input frames copied, [11] input peak,
